<!--
  Moose head silhouette for the launcher icon.

  Hand-authored rather than traced from the supplied artwork, because that image only exists inside
  the chat and never reached the filesystem. It is a close-enough stand-in, not a match: if the
  original PNG is ever saved to disk it should replace this outright, which is a drop-in swap of
  this one file plus the mipmap densities.

  Drawn on the 108dp adaptive-icon canvas; the middle 72dp (roughly 18..90) is the guaranteed-safe
  zone, so the silhouette stays inside it.
-->
